{
  "_note": "多城市取数:「我的城市」前 slots 个,**一次多坐标请求**拿全(Open-Meteo 多坐标 → 响应是数组)。\n每城市:现在的 AQI(按当前标准)+ 档位 + 24 小时走势(worse / better / steady)。\n中国标准的走势不需要逐时 AQI:分指数对浓度单调,「24 小时内最高 AQI」= 各项「24 小时最高浓度」的分指数取最大\n(max 与 max 可交换),于是每城市每项只算 3 个分指数(现在 / 24h 峰 / 6h 后峰),不必算 24 × 6 个。\npage=True 是 /city 管理页用的版本:`_cache:1` 只读首页各行已写好的缓存(不打网络),缺几座报 `miss`,\n页面再用 `_cache:0` 真取一次(G23 契约:有缓存先渲,缺的后台补)。页面只要 AQI 与档位色,不算走势。\n由 tools/infosource/gen_air.py 生成。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "id": "saved",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "cities",
        "default": []
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "行数守卫:渲染层画几行由它定。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n",
        "value": "$[length::(${saved})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sv",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "aqStd",
        "default": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_bs",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lang",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${@app.language},en)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "国内默认判据(doc/overseas-first.md §1,逐字照抄):地区 cn,或地区未知且界面中文 → 1。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "std",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${sv},cn),cn,if::(eq::(${sv},us),us,if::(eq::(${cnd},1),cn,us)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c0",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c1",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c2",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c3",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},3)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c4",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},4)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c5",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},5)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c6",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},6)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c7",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},7)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障:上一步 index:: 落地的对象,紧邻节点读取可能晚一拍。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b2",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm1",
        "value": "${c0.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm2",
        "value": "${c1.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm3",
        "value": "${c2.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm4",
        "value": "${c3.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm5",
        "value": "${c4.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm6",
        "value": "${c5.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm7",
        "value": "${c6.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm8",
        "value": "${c7.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cacheIn",
        "value": "${_cache}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "useCache",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${cacheIn},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k0",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.aq.,${std},.,${c0.lat},_,${c0.lon})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k1",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.aq.,${std},.,${c1.lat},_,${c1.lon})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k2",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.aq.,${std},.,${c2.lat},_,${c2.lon})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k3",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.aq.,${std},.,${c3.lat},_,${c3.lon})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k4",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.aq.,${std},.,${c4.lat},_,${c4.lon})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k5",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.aq.,${std},.,${c5.lat},_,${c5.lon})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k6",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.aq.,${std},.,${c6.lat},_,${c6.lon})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k7",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.aq.,${std},.,${c7.lat},_,${c7.lon})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h0",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${k0}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h1",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${k1}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h2",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${k2}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h3",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${k3}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h4",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${k4}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h5",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${k5}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h6",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${k6}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h7",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${k7}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b3",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "只读缓存(首页各行 aq.df 写的 pack,键拼法同 aq.df):不打网络。缺的座数进 miss,页面据此再真取一次。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[eq::(${useCache},1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "t0",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h0.ts},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok0",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${h0.schema},4),if::(gt::(${t0},0),if::(lt::(calc::(${nowMs}-${t0}),43200000),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ms0",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},1),if::(eq::(${ok0},1),0,1),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "aq1",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok0},1),${h0.aqi},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lvS1",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok0},1),${h0.lvS},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "t1",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h1.ts},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok1",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${h1.schema},4),if::(gt::(${t1},0),if::(lt::(calc::(${nowMs}-${t1}),43200000),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ms1",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},2),if::(eq::(${ok1},1),0,1),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "aq2",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok1},1),${h1.aqi},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lvS2",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok1},1),${h1.lvS},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "t2",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h2.ts},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok2",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${h2.schema},4),if::(gt::(${t2},0),if::(lt::(calc::(${nowMs}-${t2}),43200000),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ms2",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},3),if::(eq::(${ok2},1),0,1),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "aq3",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok2},1),${h2.aqi},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lvS3",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok2},1),${h2.lvS},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "t3",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h3.ts},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok3",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${h3.schema},4),if::(gt::(${t3},0),if::(lt::(calc::(${nowMs}-${t3}),43200000),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ms3",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},4),if::(eq::(${ok3},1),0,1),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "aq4",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok3},1),${h3.aqi},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lvS4",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok3},1),${h3.lvS},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "t4",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h4.ts},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok4",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${h4.schema},4),if::(gt::(${t4},0),if::(lt::(calc::(${nowMs}-${t4}),43200000),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ms4",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},5),if::(eq::(${ok4},1),0,1),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "aq5",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok4},1),${h4.aqi},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lvS5",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok4},1),${h4.lvS},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "t5",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h5.ts},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok5",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${h5.schema},4),if::(gt::(${t5},0),if::(lt::(calc::(${nowMs}-${t5}),43200000),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ms5",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},6),if::(eq::(${ok5},1),0,1),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "aq6",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok5},1),${h5.aqi},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lvS6",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok5},1),${h5.lvS},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "t6",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h6.ts},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok6",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${h6.schema},4),if::(gt::(${t6},0),if::(lt::(calc::(${nowMs}-${t6}),43200000),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ms6",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},7),if::(eq::(${ok6},1),0,1),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "aq7",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok6},1),${h6.aqi},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lvS7",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok6},1),${h6.lvS},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "t7",
            "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h7.ts},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok7",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${h7.schema},4),if::(gt::(${t7},0),if::(lt::(calc::(${nowMs}-${t7}),43200000),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ms7",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},8),if::(eq::(${ok7},1),0,1),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "aq8",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok7},1),${h7.aqi},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lvS8",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok7},1),${h7.lvS},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "miss",
            "value": "$[sum::(${ms0},${ms1},${ms2},${ms3},${ms4},${ms5},${ms6},${ms7})]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_note": "真取数(页面 `_cache:0` 时走这里)。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(gt::(${n},0),if::(eq::(${useCache},1),0,1),0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la0",
            "value": "${c0.lat}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo0",
            "value": "${c0.lon}"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "空槽用第一座城市的坐标补齐 —— 请求恒为 8 个坐标,响应恒是数组(单坐标时 Open-Meteo 返回的是对象)。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la1",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c1.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo1",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c1.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la2",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c2.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo2",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c2.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la3",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c3.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo3",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c3.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la4",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c4.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo4",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c4.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la5",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c5.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo5",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c5.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la6",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c6.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo6",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c6.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la7",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c7.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo7",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c7.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "一次请求拿全部城市。`timeformat=unixtime` + 不带 timezone:时间锚按**本机时区**显示\n(几座城市在不同时区,用任一座的当地时间都不对)。⚠️ formatType json 不能漏。",
          "id": "resp",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://air-quality-api.open-meteo.com/v1/air-quality?latitude=${la0},${la1},${la2},${la3},${la4},${la5},${la6},${la7}&longitude=${lo0},${lo1},${lo2},${lo3},${lo4},${lo5},${lo6},${lo7}&current=us_aqi,pm2_5,pm10,ozone,nitrogen_dioxide,sulphur_dioxide,carbon_monoxide&timeformat=unixtime",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b",
            "value": "1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "x0",
            "value": "$[index::(${resp},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "x1",
            "value": "$[index::(${resp},1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
